{"id":"2f69ce6be6444b0d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-measure4-premeasure.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Premeasure","display":"df-zfc-measure4-premeasure — ZFC Measure4 Premeasure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-premeasure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-premeasure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-premeasure — ZFC Measure4 Premeasure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-disjoint]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-powerset]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-premeasure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-premeasure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-premeasure — ZFC Measure4 Premeasure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" href=\"?note=17c8f9ebc93d5a7a\" title=\"58-df-disjoint\">58-df-disjoint</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference\">58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal R,\\mu,F\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu,F\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4Premeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4Premeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(E_+\\coloneqq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\">\\(\\infty\\notin\\mathbb R\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\">\\(E_+\\)</span> 上，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow(b=\\infty\\lor(a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land a\\leq_{\\mathbb R}b))\">\\(a\\leq b\\leftrightarrow(b=\\infty\\lor(a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land a\\leq_{\\mathbb R}b))\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\oplus b\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a+_{\\mathbb R}b,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\\\\\infty,&amp;a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty.\\end{cases}\">\\(a\\oplus b\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a+_{\\mathbb R}b,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\\\\\infty,&amp;a=\\infty\\lor b=\\infty.\\end{cases}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in E_+^\\omega\">\\(u\\in E_+^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_u\">\\(p_u\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(p_u,\\omega,E_+)\\land p_u(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(n+1)=p_u(n)\\oplus u(n))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(p_u,\\omega,E_+)\\land p_u(0)=0\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(n+1)=p_u(n)\\oplus u(n))\\)</span> 的唯一函数图。可数和是下式唯一确定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)=r\\leftrightarrow r\\in E_+\\land[\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq r)]\\land\\forall b\\in E_+\\;([\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq b)]\\to r\\leq b)\">\\(\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}u(n)=r\\leftrightarrow r\\in E_+\\land[\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq r)]\\land\\forall b\\in E_+\\;([\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;(p_u(N)\\leq b)]\\to r\\leq b)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)\">\\(\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}t(n)\\)</span> 使用函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\langle n,t(n)\\rangle:n\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>；只在各项属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_+\">\\(E_+\\)</span> 时使用。函数图及自然数分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>；本约定展开 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a> 的非负部分和约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}premeasure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal R,[0,\\infty])\\land \\mu(\\varnothing)=0\\land \\forall F\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal R)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to F(m)\\cap F(n)=\\varnothing)\\land \\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\in\\mathcal R)\\to \\mu(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n))=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(F(n))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}premeasure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4Premeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal R,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal R\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\varnothing\\in\\mathcal R\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal R\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal R\\land A\\setminus B\\in\\mathcal R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal R,[0,\\infty])\\land \\mu(\\varnothing)=0\\land \\forall F\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal R)\\land\\forall m,n\\in\\omega\\;(m\\neq n\\to F(m)\\cap F(n)=\\varnothing)\\land \\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n)\\in\\mathcal R)\\to \\mu(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}F(n))=\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}\\mu(F(n))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> is a ring of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> is an extended-nonnegative, countably additive function whenever the union remains in the ring.</li>\n<li>Arrow declarations and the unsourced disjointness predicate are expanded.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remar